# Lean Grails controllers

When editing **`grails-app/controllers/`**:

1. Keep controller actions **small, linear, and explicit**.
2. Put request binding/defaults/validation in a **command object** with `constraints` where possible.
3. Keep transport concerns in controllers; move business/domain logic to services.

Follow the general `simple-linear-code.mdc` rule when deciding whether to keep
controller logic inline or extract it.
